    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Brief voluntary discussion, with her consent. She has named a trusted colleague as her health care agent and has written down her wishes, a copy of which is now in the chart. She wants full treatment for any illness from which she could recover, and she asks that any future care plan respect her energy limits and her wish to keep working. [S]</paragraph></text>

